  "scope": "Finite seated retained-seal press on independently owned receipt at Borrin original desk, original-pixel foreground and consultant lifecycle. No ink-mark state, ledger/economic mutation, hidden sole, moving gait, other direction family or continuous-loop approval.",
  "checks": {
    "identity-and-scale": "Eight whole-sheet authored poses retain the same stocky seated Borrin, swept grey hair, spectacles, two short brass-bound grey beard tips, red cravat, cream sleeves, dark waistcoat, trousers, boots and chair. One427 source physical basis and650/[320,616] effective registration match previous seated actors. Built-in full-strip edits and source-only normalization/mattes; no limb warping, local paint, mirrors, duplicate poses or synthetic in-between.",
    "station-and-foot-contact": "near minimum correlation0.975342, maximum travel1.724617px, adjacent1.944444px; far minimum correlation0.976126, maximum travel1.887993px, adjacent1.929327px. Both8 poses pass unchanged.94 correlation/6px travel/6px adjacent limits. No whole-pose offsets are needed. These are visible stationary cap/rim regions, not an invisible heel, traveling stride or continuous world-contact certification. The actual-game view can hide boots behind camp furniture.",
    "hand-and-tool-contact": "The anatomical right hand on image left retains one upright brass seal stamp0-7. Actual visible front-rim material[282,366]in4 and[283,368]in5 lies on opaque receipt paper and is included in original-source foreground contours;2.236px press change is under unchanged6px. Skin and brass are separate contour regions so a disconnected gold-tool component cannot vanish behind the desk. Warm belt/shadow pixels are excluded from contact evidence. Other poses lift/recover/hold the stamp; no planted tool contact is claimed there. Projected material/page placement, not3D contact force or hidden underside.",
    "prop-continuity": "Actor owns body/chair/one retained stamp. Fixed independent desk owns the open ledger, ink, counter, closed books and loose receipt. Receipt is present before/after pressing and departure, and composed by one uniform source scale over archived original desk pixels. No new ink-mark state, paper transfer, resource award or automatic accounting transaction. Native0-7 layer review and functional15-variant station checks pass.",
    "completion-and-reset": "Actual Three-rendered day5 shows all8 authored poses, completes once at7, holds unchanged5000ms, keeps its finish under ordinary camera rotation, releases on departure and returns at0 only on explicit return. Desk/receipt persist. Forbidden forge assignment changes no consultant capability; day resolution leaves cosmetic activity available and day6 restores writing. All five consultant activities are freshly exercised with current served source/atlas/calibration/prop hashes. Once-hold task only, no seamless7-to0 repeat."
  },
